    section3Body: "The people who typically search for marwari pagdi tying in Goa include couples finalising their own wedding vendors, families organising the groom's side of the celebration, and planners coordinating bookings across several suppliers at once. If you already know your date and venue, we can skip straight to a package recommendation; if you're earlier in the process, we're happy to talk through options without any pressure to book immediately. For planners managing multiple weddings, we try to make the enquiry-to-quote process as quick as possible, since availability windows can shift fast during busy seasons. And if you're booking for someone else — a brother, a close friend, a family member's wedding — that's a normal part of how these bookings happen; just plan to bring the groom or couple into the conversation once it's time to settle on a specific colour or fold.",
